{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Have I been with you all [Eb]this time
[Gm]And you still do not know [F]me
Who[Eb]ever has [F]seen me [Gm]has seen the Fa[Eb]ther
How can you ask to [F]see Him
Do [Eb]you not [F]believe I [Gm]am in the Fa[Eb]ther
And the Father is in [F]me
[Eb]The words [F]I speak [Gm]are not [Eb]my own
The Father living in me does His [F]works
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
I tell you the [Bb]truth
Who[F]ever believes in [Gm]me
Will do [Eb]the works I [Bb]am doing
And [F]will do e[Gm]ven [F]greater [Eb]things
Because I [F]am going to the Fa[Bb]ther
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb]Whatever you [F]ask in my [Gm]name
[Eb]I will [Bb]do it for the [F]Father
So [Eb]that He may [F]be glorified [Gm]in the [Eb]Son
If you ask me [F]anything in my [Gm]name
I will [Eb]do it
If you [F]love me you will keep my command[Bb]ments
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
I tell you the truth
Who[F]ever believes in [Gm]me
Will do [Eb]the works I [Bb]am doing
And [F]will do e[Gm]ven [F]greater [Eb]things
